#: ../../zh/index.rst:17
msgid ""
"**Triton-Ascend** "
"是适配华为Ascend处理器的Triton优化版本，主要用于提供高效的核函数自动调优、算子编译及部署能力，支持Ascend Atlas "
"A2/A3/950系列产品，兼容Triton核心语法的同时，针对昇腾NPU特性进行了深度优化，包括自动解析核函数参数、优化内存访问逻辑、完善安全部署机制等。"
msgstr ""
"**Triton-Ascend** is an optimized version of Triton adapted for Huawei "
"Ascend processors. It provides efficient kernel autotuning, operator "
"compilation, and deployment capabilities. It supports Ascend Atlas A2/A3/950"
" series products. While remaining compatible with core Triton syntax, it is "
"deeply optimized for Ascend NPU features, including automatically parsing "
"kernel parameters, optimizing memory access logic, and improving secure "
"deployment mechanisms."
